WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.735
[music playing]

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:05.839
NARRATOR: September,
1944, south-east of Japan,

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.074
USS Finback steams
toward the crash

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:10.677
site of an American plane.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:14.214
10 miles away, a young pilot
drifts towards the shores

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.183
of a Japanese island
from which enemy

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.085
ships set out towards him.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:22.455
[music playing]

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.157
The situation appears hopeless.

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:26.693
[music playing]

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.130
Until two American planes from
his squadron appear overhead.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:34.134
[music playing]

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.939
[shooting]

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:43.042
The Avenger aircraft strafed
the Japanese vessels.

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:46.146
[shooting]

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:50.617
And they retreat to the
protection of the shore.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.219
But now low on fuel,
the American planes

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.721
must return to their carrier.

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:00.093
[music playing]

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.796
The Aviator is vulnerable
and alone again.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:09.102
[music playing]

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.471
To the south, USS
Finback approaches

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:14.441
the coordinates of
the downed airmen,

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:16.576
guided in by its air cover.

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:18.645
[music playing]

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.380
LOOKOUT: Life raft,
off the starboard bow.

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:23.817
NARRATOR: At last, a lookout
spots a bright yellow object

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.018
in the vast Pacific.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:29.456
[music playing]

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.659
From the life raft after
more than three hours of fear

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:35.428
and struggle, the
20-year-old pilot

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:39.766
believes he has started to
hallucinate as he sees what

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.268
he describes as an apparition.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:46.873
First a dark spot, then
a submarine emerges.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.778
He worries that
might be Japanese.

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:55.615
[music playing]

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:04.123
But he identifies the
men on board with relief.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.458
They are American.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:10.396
[music playing]

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:16.169
USS Finback's photographic
officer rolls his camera.

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:19.339
Five submariners gather at
Finback's bow to recover

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:21.107
the bobbing life raft.

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:27.247
[music playing]

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:41.160
Just before noon, more than
three hours after the crash,

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.496
they pulled the
young pilot aboard.

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:49.269
[music playing]

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:54.908
He is safe.

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.210
[music playing]

